      "description": "Added the level 12 Super Valkyrie."
    }
  ],
  "facts": [
    "The Super Valkyrie is a Super Troop based on the Valkyrie. It can be unlocked by boosting the Valkyrie when the Valkyrie is at least level 7.",
    "Boosting the Valkyrie requires 25,000 Dark Elixir or a Super Potion, and doing so allows the Valkyrie to be boosted for 3 days. The level of Super Valkyrie you obtain from the boost corresponds to the level of Valkyrie you have.",
    "Because of the level requirement, players require Town Hall 12 in order to boost Valkyries into Super Valkyries. However, because of the Laboratory level cap, players require a level 6 Clan Castle or greater in order to get donated one, allowing anyone Town Hall 10 or above to get one."
  ],
